const e = s => String(s ?? '').replace(/[&<>"']/g, c => ({'&': '&amp;', '<': '&lt;', '>': '&gt;', '"': '&quot;', "'": '&#39;'}[c]));
const date = d => d ? new Date(d + 'T12:00:00').toLocaleDateString('en-US', {month: 'short', day: 'numeric'}) : '—';
const all = queries.projects.data || [];
const p = all.find(x => x.id === variables.focusProjectId) || all.find(x => x.status === 'Active') || all[0];
const items = p?.issues || [], done = items.filter(i => i.status === 'Verified').length;
const locs = [...new Set(items.map(i => i.location))].map(loc => { const is = items.filter(i => i.location === loc), n = is.filter(i => i.status === 'Verified').length; return { name: loc, count: n + '/' + is.length, pct: is.length ? Math.round(100 * n / is.length) : 0 }; });
const q = all.find(x => x.id === variables.projectId);
const hist = (q?.history || []).slice().reverse().map(h => ({ lineHtml: '<b>' + e(h.event) + '</b> <span style="color:var(--cc-placeholder-text)">' + e(h.note) + '</span>' }));
return {
  eyebrow: (p?.reference || 'PROJECT') + ' / ' + (p?.status || 'No active site'),
  name: p?.name || 'Create your first project',
  clientSite: (p?.client || '') + ' · ' + (p?.site || ''),
  leadHtml: 'Site lead <b style="color:var(--cc-primary-text)">' + e(p?.lead || '—') + '</b>',
  targetHtml: 'Target <b style="color:var(--cc-primary-text)">' + date(p?.target_date) + '</b>',
  pct: items.length ? Math.round(100 * done / items.length) : 0,
  verified: done + ' / ' + items.length,
  locations: locs,
  locNote: locs.length ? 'Verified work by unit or room' : 'Add punch items to create a location register.',
  handMeta: (q?.lead || '—') + ' · Target ' + date(q?.target_date),
  history: hist.length ? hist : [{ lineHtml: '<span style="color:var(--cc-placeholder-text)">Verify every punch item before recording the final handover.</span>' }]
};
